  "body": "* 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and a double internal-access garage\r\n* 192sqm floor area on a generous 666sqm section\r\n* Single-level layout with seamless indoor-outdoor flow\r\n* Elevated, north-facing position with valley views\r\n* North-facing deck with an electric louvre system\r\n* Low-maintenance grounds and additional off-street parking\r\n\r\nSet on one of Millwater's popular streets, this well-presented single-level home combines a convenient location with an elevated outlook and generous outdoor space.\r\n\r\nThe living areas flow naturally onto the north-facing deck, creating an inviting setting for relaxed family living and entertaining. An electric louvre system adds flexibility to outdoor living, allowing you to enjoy the space in a range of weather conditions.\r\n\r\nFrom its elevated position, the home enjoys valley views and plenty of natural light. The four-bedroom layout includes a master bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, while the remaining bedrooms are serviced by a family bathroom and separate toilet.\r\n\r\nThe generous 666sqm section offers space for children and pets, with grounds that are easy to maintain. A double internal-access garage and additional off-street parking add everyday convenience, with room to accommodate a boat or caravan.\r\n\r\nThe location is another advantage, local parks and KingsWay School within walking distance, plus convenient motorway access. Spend sunny days at beautiful Red Beach or Orewa, explore the nearby coastline, or enjoy the shopping and cafés of Silverdale and Orewa. \r\n\r\nCombining a popular Millwater location, elevated views and practical single-level living, this home offers an appealing option for families seeking space and convenience.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes. Learn more at www.vinsonamyandco.nz.",
